{"2707980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PUNK", "steam_appid": 2707980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNK is an open world bullet hell action roguelike. Fight vicious creatures, explore diverse biomes, hone your movement skills, manage resources, tinker with weapons and gadgets to upgrade your tiny ship until you become the apex predator of this strange, alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular upgrade system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving in a hostile alien world is not easy - especially for a tiny spaceship. Your ship, your weapons, and your tools can be upgraded by placing modules on a 2D grid. Plan ahead because positioning matters just as much as choosing the right modules. With the right layout you can become the most terrifying force… at least until something even more dangerous shows up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/9f38208decc334815df907ceb0afe778.poster.avif?t=1781079066\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/9f38208decc334815df907ceb0afe778.webm?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/9f38208decc334815df907ceb0afe778.mp4?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprawling open world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious otherworldly environment, uncover its secrets and learn to use its different ecosystems to your advantage. Your surroundings are often destructible with the right tools so shoot, make explosions, set things on fire! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/8b4cea5394da0b2a87c33f07786f42ab.poster.avif?t=1781079066\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/8b4cea5394da0b2a87c33f07786f42ab.webm?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/8b4cea5394da0b2a87c33f07786f42ab.mp4?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving bullet hell combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter a vast number of creatures and they are all ready to rain hellfire upon you. The smooth and responsive movement of your ship and various tools will help you to fight back. But don’t forget that sometimes it is wiser to avoid difficult combat situations until you are ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/a8f132e45e84abb7e97995a94ff791fe.poster.avif?t=1781079066\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/a8f132e45e84abb7e97995a94ff791fe.webm?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/a8f132e45e84abb7e97995a94ff791fe.mp4?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scarce resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What looks like an empty wasteland hides valuable materials for those who know how to find them. Strange compounds scattered across the terrain can be harnessed as ammunition for sophisticated weaponry. Stay vigilant about your supplies, keep your mining tools ready, and carefully manage the demands of your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/67ea6f660d650bc1d84f138b5d1faf90.poster.avif?t=1781079066\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/67ea6f660d650bc1d84f138b5d1faf90.webm?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/67ea6f660d650bc1d84f138b5d1faf90.mp4?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the fun (and the suffering) with a friend. Be careful, because the enemies will become even more bloodthirsty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/c8067511eccd1f08086ab1a518e68c53.poster.avif?t=1781079066\" width=1170 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/c8067511eccd1f08086ab1a518e68c53.webm?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707980/extras/c8067511eccd1f08086ab1a518e68c53.mp4?t=1781079066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you have feedback or just want to hang out with the community join our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNK is an open world bullet hell act